Z||000015||Pyric||12-03-2001||06:47 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by jelly2m8:<BR><B>One that you're not always working on!<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>Sorry, couldn't resist....<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well... When I got mine the guy told me "If you don't like working on cars... don't get a Fiero."  <P>Hell, half the time I'm just wrenching her for fun.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>And when I want to keep her intact... I'll go to the junkyard and pull pieces out of theirs.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> <P>I must be disturbed:   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">  <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Pyric (edited 12-03-2001).]||||reg||1
