Z||000017||CoolBlue87GT||12-03-2001||10:49 PM||||I've had both the 84 4 cly & 85 V6 coupe style.<P>When I had them, I loved them. they were both red.<P>When the GT style came out, I loved that also. I leaned towards the dark maroon color.<P>But when the 87 Blue color was created, I fell in love. Oh, I just had to have it.<P>Yes, the 88's are better handling . - Although the way I've drivin mine, it handles fine for me.<P>There are many Fiero's out there that are works of art, like Skitime's Fiero is just beautiful.<P>To sum it up, I love all Fiero's, and the blue 87 GT's the most. Not just I have one.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CoolBluesig.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 12-03-2001).]||||reg||6
